  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\alpha \\neq \\mathrm{a}, \\beta \\neq \\mathrm{b}, \\gamma \\neq \\mathrm{c}$ and $\\left|\\begin{array}{lll}\\alpha & \\mathrm{b} & \\mathrm{c} \\\\ \\mathrm{a} & \\beta & \\mathrm{c} \\\\ \\mathrm{a} & \\mathrm{b} & \\gamma\\end{array}\\right|=0$, then $\\frac{\\mathrm{a}}{\\alpha-\\mathrm{a}}+\\frac{\\mathrm{b}}{\\beta-\\mathrm{b}}+\\frac{\\gamma}{\\gamma-\\mathrm{c}}$ is equal to:",
